    "marginal_cost_note": "Each extra $1 allocated to the Class VI non-compete (out of goodwill) costs Ray about $0.30 of after-tax proceeds (37% vs 20% character, plus 21% Class VI BIG tax, less the 7.77-point recapture of the pass-through loss against ordinary income)."
